    "description": "Media Research Institute,Inc. plans, manages, and implements employment-related projects in Japan. The company offers career research seminars for technical college students, as well as science and engineering industry research seminars and career networking events for female science and engineering students. It also provides Kosen Plus, an information navigation site providing career support to technical college students, and operates an web media platform that conveys the appeal of technical colleges. In addition, the company acts as an agent for career-related events organized by technical colleges. Further, the company provides job hunting handbook and produces recruitment content for websites, videos, brochures, and other printed materials. The company was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Fukuoka City, Japan."
